{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-93-1","title":"Psalms 93:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":93,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":93,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The majesty, stability, power, and holiness of Christ's kingdom.</p>\n<p>(Title.)It is highly probable that this Psalm was written on the same occasion as the preceding, as a part of which it is written in twelve MSS.</p>\n<p>Lord. 59:13; 96:10; 97:1; 99:1; 103:19; 145:13; 1Ch 29:12; Isa 52:7 Da 4:32-34; Mt 6:13; Heb 1:8; Re 11:15-17; 19:6 he is. 104:1,2; Job 40:10; Isa 59:17; 63:1 he hath. 18:32; 65:6; Isa 11:5 world. 75:3; 96:10; Isa 45:12,18; 49:8; 51:16; Heb 1:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-93-2","title":"Psalms 93:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":93,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":93,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Thy. 45:6; 145:13; Pr 8:22,23; Da 4:34; Mic 5:2 of old. Heb. from then. thou. 90:2; 102:24-27; Heb 1:10-12; 13:8; Re 1:8,11,17,18; 2:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-93-3","title":"Psalms 93:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":93,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":93,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>The floods. 18:4; 69:1,2,14-16; Isa 17:12,13; Jer 46:7,8; Jon 2:3; Re 12:15 Re 17:15 lifted. 96:11; 98:8; Isa 55:12 the floods lift. 2:1-3; 107:25,26; 124:3-5; Ac 4:25-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-93-4","title":"Psalms 93:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":93,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":93,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>mightier. 65:7; 89:6,9; 114:3-5; Job 38:11; Jer 5:22; Mr 4:37-39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-93-5","title":"Psalms 93:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":93,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":93,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Thy. 19:7,8; 119:111,129,138,144; Isa 8:20; Mt 24:35; Heb 6:17,18 1Jo 5:9-13 holiness. 5:4-7; 99:5,9; Le 10:3; 19:2; Isa 52:11; Zec 14:20,21; Joh 4:24 1Co 3:16,17; Heb 12:14; Re 21:27 for ever. Heb. to length of days.</p>"}]}